  <body>
   <p><date when="1860-11-22">22</date> 
<lb/>The <persName ref="cwgk:N00000258">Governor</persName> issued a Requisition in <placeName ref="cwgk:P00002302">Louisiana</placeName> for the apprehension of <persName ref="cwgk:N00014737">Geo. Woodruff</persName> an escaped convict and appointed <persName ref="cwgk:N00017460">Saml. South</persName> his Agent to make the demand</p>
<p>He caused to be filed the Oath of <persName ref="cwgk:N00001703">Geo. W. Thompson</persName> Com<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">r</hi></hi> of Deeds for <placeName ref="cwgk:P001818">Indiana</placeName>.<pb/></p>
<p><note place="header">145</note></p>
<p><date when="1860">1860</date> Executive Journal</p>
<p><date when="1860-11-22">Nov 22</date> 
<lb/>The Governor respited for twelve months the following Judgments</p>
<p><table rend="rules">
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000585">Warren Cir Ct.</orgName> vs. <persName ref="cwgk:N00021163">Ja<hi rend="sup">s</hi> Whitlow</persName></cell>
	<cell>$50.</cell>
	<cell>Concealed weapons</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000411">Knox</orgName> " " " <persName ref="cwgk:N00021164">H L Murphy</persName></cell>
	<cell>$60 -- </cell>
	<cell>Tipling</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000431">Meade</orgName> " " " <persName ref="cwgk:N00021165">W</persName>. &amp; <persName ref="cwgk:N00011852">P. A Perry</persName></cell>
	<cell>$200.</cell>
	<cell>Gaming</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000489">Pendleton</orgName> " " " <persName ref="cwgk:N00003824">Lewis Perry</persName></cell>
	<cell>$23<unclear>.</unclear>20.</cell>
	<cell>Profane Swearing</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000362">Christian</orgName> " " " <persName ref="cwgk:N00021167">Taylor</persName> &amp; <persName ref="cwgk:N00021166">West</persName> -- </cell>
	<cell>2 Judgts -- each $150. -- </cell>
	<cell>Tipling</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell>Do " " " <persName ref="cwgk:N00018778">L. Kinstler</persName> -- </cell>
	<cell>$150.</cell>
	<cell>"</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell>Do " " " Do</cell>
	<cell>$50</cell>
	<cell>"</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000426">Mason</orgName> " " " <persName ref="cwgk:N00021168">Geo. Bancroft</persName></cell>
	<cell>$20 -- </cell>
	<cell>Selling liquor</cell>
</row>
</table></p>
<p>He remitted the following Judgments to wit:</p>
<p><table rend="rules">
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000421">Muhlenberg Cir. Ct</orgName> vs <persName ref="cwgk:N00008097">Jo<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">s</hi></hi> Witley</persName> -- </cell>
	<cell>$50.</cell>
	<cell>selling liquor to a slave</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000375">Estill</orgName> " " " <persName ref="cwgk:N00021257">S. P. M<hi rend="sup">c</hi>Mahon</persName> -- </cell>
	<cell>$50.</cell>
	<cell>concealed weapons.</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O001838">Louisville City</orgName> " " <persName ref="cwgk:N00021462">W<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">m</hi></hi> Goodlow</persName></cell>
	<cell>$50.</cell>
	<cell>Do Do</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell>Do Do " " <persName ref="cwgk:N00021461">W<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">m</hi></hi> M. Duncan</persName> -- </cell>
	<cell>$300.</cell>
	<cell>Forfeited recognizance</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000661">Mason J. P.</orgName> " " <persName ref="cwgk:N00008123">G W Horton</persName></cell>
	<cell>$9.</cell>
	<cell>breach of the peace</cell>
</row>
</table></p>
